DESCRIPTION:“Rush Hour Comedy Night” w/ SFs Best Black & Asian Comedia
 ns (The Function)\nHellaFunny\nWelcome to ‘Rush Hour Comedy Night’ whe
 re laughter knows no bounds and cultural collisions are the name of the ga
 me. Join our dynamic duo of black and Asian comedians as they embark on a 
 whirlwind adventure through the streets of humor\, weaving together their 
 diverse backgrounds and comedic chops to deliver a show that’s as unpred
 ictable as rush hour traffic.\nFrom sharp-witted stand-up routines to hila
 rious storytelling and crowd work\, “Rush Hour Comedy Night” brings yo
 u non-stop laughs from start to finish.\n———————–\n> First
  100 people to RSVP get free tickets.\nEVERY FRIDAY\, SATURDAY NIGHTS\nTWO
  SHOWS – 7PM + 9PM\n\nEnjoy a 70-90 minute show with 4-5 comics on the b
 ill with credits like Cobbs\, Punchline\, SF Sketchfest\, Clusterfest and 
 Outside Lands.\nFREE with Eventbrite RSVP – Donations appreciated – br
 ing cash\n\nMAXIMUM TWO COMP TICKETS PER PERSON – If you have additional
  guests you’d like to bring\, they must RSVP separately\n$25 door – Ad
 mission is first come first served\nLike most comedy clubs\, there is a tw
 o-drink minimum to help support the bar and waitstaff\n\nLike all things i
 n life\, the comedy lineup is subject to change.\n———-\n$20 TIX AVAI
 LABLE (50) AT DOOR – When Advanced Tix are sold out\n\nAbout The Functio
 n\nIntroducing The Function\, a vibrant addition to the city’s entertain
 ment scene\, where laughter reigns supreme and every night is a celebratio
 n of comedic brilliance. Near Hayes Valley...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://
 www.eventbrite.com/e/rush-hour-comedy-night-w-sfs-best-black-asian-stand-u
 p-comedians-tickets-905741947547\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/rush-ho
 ur-comedy-night-w-sfs-best-black-asian-comedians-the-function-143/\nSource
 : Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/https_
 __cdn.evbuc_.com_images_766855059_893605758_1_original.jpeg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T154147Z
LOCATION:The Function\, 1414 Market Street\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/rush-hour-comedy-night-w-sfs-best-black-asian-
 comedians-the-function-143/
