BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cheaper Than Therapy: Stand-Up Comedy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T194500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T214500
DTSTAMP:20261126T170128Z
UID:dothebay-9842179@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:CTT Comedy presents\n\nCheaper Than Therapy: Stand-Up Comedy\n
 \nEvery Friday @ 7:45pm | Shelton Theater\n\nCheaper Than Therapy\noffers 
 a healthy dose of live stand-up comedy every Wednesday\, Thursday\,\nFrida
 y\, Saturday\, and Sunday\, year-round. Located in San Francisco's\nhistor
 ic\nShelton Theater\nin the heart of Union Square\, Cheaper Than Therapy i
 s convenient to get to\,\nwhether you live in the Bay Area or are just vis
 iting.\n\nCheck out our reviews on\nYelp\,\nGoogle\, and Facebook.\n\nAbou
 t the show\n\nEach show features five to six hand-picked\, experienced com
 edians and an\noccasional guest drop-in.\n\nPlease arrive at the theater b
 y 7:30pm to check in with the box office. The\nbar opens at 7pm\, and the 
 show starts at 7:45pm. Last seating is at\n8:05pm.\n\nThe theater has a fu
 ll bar with no drink minimum. Come early for craft\ndrinks and great seats
 !\n\nThe show always ends by 9:15pm\, so there is plenty of time to catch 
 the BART\nor MUNI. For a list of restaurant recommendations in the area\, 
 please visit\nour website.\n\nAfter the show\, we encourage everyone 21+ t
 o party with us at the Shelton\nTheater bar.\n\nFrequently asked questions
 \n\nIs there an age requirement?\nThe show is for mature audience\nmembers
  of 18+ only.\n\nIs there a drink minimum?\nNo\, there is no drink minimum
 .\n\nWhat if I'm late?\nThis is a live show\, and we want everyone to\nhav
 e a great time. As a courtesy to the performers and audience\, we will not
 \nseat those who arrive after 8:05pm. If you are unable to make it by this
 \ntime\, please let us kno...\n\n$25\, 18+\nCTT COMEDY Presents\n\nTickets
 : https://tickets.cttcomedy.com/events?utm_source=dothebay&utm_medium=orga
 nic&utm_campaign=events\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/fri/c
 heaper-than-therapy-stand-up-comedy\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.78902490000001;-122.4091439
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/251248/8dde3f2a-701d-4359-90aa-87fd8bd7ff17.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261126T170128Z
LOCATION:Shelton Theater\, 533 Sutter St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/fri/cheaper-than-therapy-stand-up-c
 omedy
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“The Stoner Comedy Jam” Friday Nights
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639236@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:“The Stoner Comedy Jam” Friday Nights (SF)\nHellaFunny\nYo
 u know what makes stand-up comedy funnier? Smoking while watching it live!
  Come to San Francisco’s premiere cannabis club Moe Greens every Friday 
 night for a night of laughter and\, well\, getting stoned.\nHellaFunny is 
 taking over the cannabis lounge at Moe Greens for the Stoner Comedy Jam. I
 t’s one of the only comedy show in San Francisco where you can (legally 
 in California) get high during the show.\n\nThe Stoner Comedy Jam\nEvery F
 riday at 8pm\nMoe Greens\, 1276 Market St.\, San Francisco\nFree with Gues
 t List RSVP\n\nIt’s a 70+ minute show with 4-5 of SF’s top local comic
 s on the bill\n21+ only\nOne item minimum purchase required\n\nFAQ\nIs thi
 s comedy show really free?\nYes! Just make sure to RSVP to get on the gues
 tlist. You must be 21+.\nTell me about the one-item minimum.\nIn order to 
 hook you up with this free comedy show\, there’s one-item minimum purcha
 se per person\, but it’s super affordable (and way cheaper than a tradit
 ional two-drink minimum at a bar!)\nDo I need a medical marijuana card?\nN
 ope! All you need to be is 21+ and have a valid ID.\nDo I have to smoke du
 ring the show?\nNope! You can smoke\, dab\, eat a gummy.. whatever you wan
 t! Or you can just enjoy the show. The one-item minimum purchase still app
 lies. So buy something and a give it to a friend! If you do decide to cons
 ume onsite\, just make sure to take is slow and know your body and your li
 mits.\nCan I bring outside weed?\nSorry! That’s not cool (and it’s not
  legal). In...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.universe.com/events/the-sf-
 stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-at-8p-tickets-8P0JBR\nDetails: https://sf.
 funcheap.com/the-stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-sf-191/\nSource: Funcheap
  SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/HalfBa
 ked_eventbrite.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Moe Greens\, 1276 Market St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/the-stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-sf-191/
END:VEVENT
