 ho perform the best will be booked on an upcoming professional showcase. T
 his is a completely free show. Tips are appreciated!\nThis comedy show is 
 hosted & produced by Emon Dismore. Emon Dismore is an up & coming Bay Area
  comedian who’s “Man on the Street” style interviews have amassed ov
 er 40 million views across instagram alone.\n\nFollow @peninsulacomedy and
  @emondismore if you’re a fan of comedy and want to stay updated on futu
 re events.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2004950148867?
