DESCRIPTION:SF’s Free “Black Friday” Comedy Fest at Black-Owned Come
 dy Club (Nov. 27-28)\nFuncheap\nBlack Friday Comedy Weekend at SF’s ONLY
  BLACK-OWNED COMEDY CLUB\n\nSpend Black Friday 2026 weekend with some of t
 he funniest Black comedians from San Francisco and across the Bay Area. We
 ’re putting on four shows at The Function\, SF’s only Black-owned come
 dy club\, co-owned by local comedy star\, Stroy Moyd.\nRSVP for FREE Ticke
 ts (21+)\nEach show packs 70-90 minutes of nonstop stand-up with 4-5 stand
 out comics whose credits typically include Cobb’s Comedy Club\, Punch Li
 ne\, SF Sketchfest\, and Cheaper Than Therapy. You might even catch a surp
 rise drop-in from a touring headliner or a rising Bay Area comic.\nThe sho
 wroom is intimate\, so you’ll be right up close to the comics. Come earl
 y for a craft cocktail or one of our many non-alcoholic options\, or head 
 upstairs to the lounge after the show to keep the night going. Bring a dat
 e\, round up your friends and night out.\nBLACK FRIDAY COMEDY FEST 2026\nS
 HOWTIMES\n\nFriday\, November 27\, 2026 at 7pm and 9pm\nSaturday\, Novembe
 r 28\, 2026 at 7pm and 9pm\n\nHosted inside SF’s only Black-owned comedy
  club co-owned by Stroy Moyd (STARZ’ Blindspotting)\, this show is about
  spotlighting the depth\, diversity\, and talent of the local comedy scene
  – while still delivering big laughs and a great night out.\n✨ What to
  expect\n\n70-90 minute comedy show\n4-5 standout comedians\nIntimate\, up
 -close comedy club vibes\nInnovative craft cocktails + full bar\, beer\, w
 ine and N/A options\nU...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e
 /black-friday-comedy-weekend-at-sfs-only-black-owned-comedy-club-tickets-2
 005544711219\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-free-black-friday-comed
 y-fest-blackowned-comedy-club-nov-2728/\nSource: Funcheap SF
