DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerEmon Dismore“Acidic Laughs @
 Alpha Acid Brewing Co” is the Newest and Hottest Comedy Show in the Peni
 nsula. The Bubbly is pouring\, the kegs are unloading\, and the laughs are
  echoing through this very intimate space. Come down to Alpha Acid Brewing
  Co on Saturday\, November 28th at 7:30 pm and enjoy award-winning beer wh
 ile enjoying top local talent. We have comedians who are performing at all
  the local clubs such as\; The San Francisco Punchline\, Cobbs Comedy Club
 \, and the San Jose Improv. A few of our comedians have even toured the co
 untry and have performed at some of the most prestigious venues like the 
 “The Stand” in New York or the “Comedy Mothership” in Austin. If y
 ou have no plans\, feel like doing something different\, and are in the mo
 od for laughing\, this is the show for you!\nFeature Comedians: Israel Med
 ina (SF Sketchfest)\, Gio (The Function)\, Rafael Arroyo (Indie Sleaze Com
 ed)\, Edith Peng (San Francisco Punchline)\, Emon Dismore (Peninsula Comed
 y)\, and the Headliner for this show is Jason Cole (Best of SF). This come
 dy show is hosted & produced by Peninsula Comedy. Follow us @peninsulacome
