SUMMARY:Jeff Arcuri
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270122T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270122T210000
DTSTAMP:20261127T014655Z
UID:dothebay-17517176@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:The Road Trip Tour\nJeff Arcuri\nFriday\, January 22 | ​The 
 Masonic\n\nDoors open at 6pm\nMUST BE 16+\n\nThe Chicago Tribune hails JEF
 F ARCURI as "a joke machine\," but he's much more than that--he's a person
 ! Jeff has showcased his talent on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, Co
 medy Central's Roast Battle\, Laughs! on Fox\, SiriusXM\, and numerous com
 edy festivals nationwide. His subreddit\, r/JeffArcuri\, ranks in the top 
 1% of all subreddits\, boasting over 235\,000 active members. This makes h
 im one of the pioneering comedians on the platform\, frequently landing on
  the front page.\n\nJeff's ticket-selling prowess has soared dramatically.
  In spring 2023\, he was performing in 200-capacity comedy clubs\, but by 
 June 2024\, he had ascended to headlining theaters with a capacity of 3\,0
 00\, consistently selling out 3-5 shows every weekend. In 2024 alone\, Jef
 f sold over 250\,000 tickets in over 25 countries.\n\nJeff recently headli
 ned two sold out performances at the iconic Beacon Theatre for the New Yor
 k Comedy Festival as well as a four-show sold out residency at The Wiltern
  in Los Angeles.\n\n16+\nThe Road Trip Tour\n\nTickets: https://ticketmast
 er.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tick
 etmaster.com%2Fjeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-san-francisco-california-01-
 22-2027%2Fevent%2F1C0064D1D30745C5\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2
 027/1/22/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso 
 listed on:\n- https://www.ticketmaster.com/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-
 san-francisco-california-01-22-2027/event/1C0064D1D30745C5?utm_source=cald
 iscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
GEO:37.7911829;-122.412938
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32883447/ee76abbf-cb73-4aaf-a7fd-9361dc0710fa.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261127T014655Z
LOCATION:The Masonic\, 1111 California St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94108
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2027/1/22/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-t
