BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jeff Arcuri
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270123T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270123T200000
DTSTAMP:20261127T014655Z
UID:dothebay-17517177@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:The Road Trip Tour\nJeff Arcuri\nSaturday\, January 23 | ​Th
 e Masonic\n\nDoors open at 5pm\nMUST BE 16+\n\nThe Chicago Tribune hails J
 EFF ARCURI as "a joke machine\," but he's much more than that--he's a pers
 on! Jeff has showcased his talent on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, 
 Comedy Central's Roast Battle\, Laughs! on Fox\, SiriusXM\, and numerous c
 omedy festivals nationwide. His subreddit\, r/JeffArcuri\, ranks in the to
 p 1% of all subreddits\, boasting over 235\,000 active members. This makes
  him one of the pioneering comedians on the platform\, frequently landing 
 on the front page.\n\nJeff's ticket-selling prowess has soared dramaticall
 y. In spring 2023\, he was performing in 200-capacity comedy clubs\, but b
 y June 2024\, he had ascended to headlining theaters with a capacity of 3\
 ,000\, consistently selling out 3-5 shows every weekend. In 2024 alone\, J
 eff sold over 250\,000 tickets in over 25 countries.\n\nJeff recently head
 lined two sold out performances at the iconic Beacon Theatre for the New Y
 ork Comedy Festival as well as a four-show sold out residency at The Wilte
 rn in Los Angeles.\n\n16+\nThe Road Trip Tour\n\nTickets: https://ticketma
 ster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ti
 cketmaster.com%2Fjeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-san-francisco-california-0
 1-23-2027%2Fevent%2F1C0064D1D30C45CB\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2027/1/23/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAls
 o listed on:\n- https://www.ticketmaster.com/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tou
 r-san-francisco-california-01-23-2027/event/1C0064D1D30C45CB?utm_source=ca
 ldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\n- https://www.tic
 ketmaster.com/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-san-francisco-california-01-2
 3-2027/event/1C0064D1D31045D8?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_c
 ampaign=san-francisco-ca
GEO:37.7911829;-122.412938
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32883452/d72c3145-38b4-4fda-bf51-ab4d5201bfd2.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261127T014655Z
LOCATION:The Masonic\, 1111 California St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94108
