UID:dothebay-17786163@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:The Road Trip Tour\nJeff Arcuri\nSunday\, January 24 | ​The 
 Masonic\n\nDoors open at 9pm\nMUST BE 16+\n\nThe Chicago Tribune hails JEF
 F ARCURI as "a joke machine\," but he's much more than that--he's a person
 ! Jeff has showcased his talent on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, Co
 medy Central's Roast Battle\, Laughs! on Fox\, SiriusXM\, and numerous com
 edy festivals nationwide. His subreddit\, r/JeffArcuri\, ranks in the top 
 1% of all subreddits\, boasting over 235\,000 active members. This makes h
 im one of the pioneering comedians on the platform\, frequently landing on
  the front page.\n\nJeff's ticket-selling prowess has soared dramatically.
  In spring 2023\, he was performing in 200-capacity comedy clubs\, but by 
 June 2024\, he had ascended to headlining theaters with a capacity of 3\,0
 00\, consistently selling out 3-5 shows every weekend. In 2024 alone\, Jef
 f sold over 250\,000 tickets in over 25 countries.\n\nJeff recently headli
 ned two sold out performances at the iconic Beacon Theatre for the New Yor
 k Comedy Festival as well as a four-show sold out residency at The Wiltern
  in Los Angeles.\n\nThe Road Trip Tour\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.ev
 yy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmas
 ter.com%2Fjeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-san-francisco-california-01-24-20
 27%2Fevent%2F1C0064D1D31445E5\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2027/1
 /24/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso liste
 d on:\n- https://www.ticketmaster.com/jeff-arcuri-the-road-trip-tour-san-f
 rancisco-california-01-24-2027/event/1C0064D1D31445E5?utm_source=caldiscov
 ery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
