SUMMARY:The Bay Area Pun Off at SF Sketchfest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270127T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270127T210000
DTSTAMP:20261127T123954Z
UID:funcheap-1648369@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer@worldwidepunsofficialThe Bay 
 Area Pun Off was born in a living room in Oakland in 2016 and grew organic
 ally to serve the wordplay/nerdplay community. We’re thirlled to be back
  at Sketchfest after selling out Cobb’s last year – and we can’t wai
 t to meet more new friends! The show features brave punslingers going head
  to head on fresh topics in timed elimination rounds until only one Pun Ch
 amp remains. The lineup mixes Pun Off all-star favorites with Sketchfest g
 uests\, including local up and coming comic Natasha Vinik\, a newcomer who
  won back-to-back championships last spring\, Spencer Devine\, John Beard\
 , and Natasha Muse. Part sport\, part show\, part community event for frie
 nds of wordplay… if you turn to either side of you\, you’re guaranteed
  to meet someone who also came to a Pun Off on purpose!\n\n$30.00\n\nTicke
 ts: https://www.ticketmaster.com/sf-sketchfest-presents-the-bay-area-san-f
 rancisco-california-01-27-2027/event/1C00656D460A1A48\nDetails: https://sf
 .funcheap.com/bay-area-pun-sf-sketchfest/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/JonahB
 radyFacePalmCaveat.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261127T123954Z
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Ave\, San Francisco\, CA 9413
 3
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/bay-area-pun-sf-sketchfest/
END:VEVENT
